{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20265YPIdOMIY91794667824.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國據報曾建議烏克蘭割地，換取加入北約。</p><p></p><p>烏克蘭通訊社報道，總統澤連斯基表示，美國方面曾經詢問烏方是否願意放棄頓巴斯地區，以換取北約成員國的資格。澤連斯基稱是首次有人提出這個問題，但他重申烏克蘭不會撤退，也不會放棄領土。</p><p></p><p>澤連斯基表示，俄羅斯在對烏克蘭的戰爭中，把一切押注在今年冬季的攻勢上，烏方要求北約和歐盟提供安全保障。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T15:50:00.478334+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":162,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T14:41:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T15:43:03.987956+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T15:43:03.987956+00:00","content_hash":"7401d0bc5e61a188c6e85b58a44a52d2735129ee974407fbad51b08bbecaba30","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}